{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"tools":{"listChanged":false}},"serverInfo":{"name":"frap","title":"frap (headless Blender 5.2 API)","version":"0.1.0"},"instructions":"frap edits a persistent 3D scene headlessly with Blender 5.2's Python API names (bpy.ops, bpy.data, bpy.context). Use frap_exec to run statements (one per line; no variables: use full paths such as bpy.data.objects['Cube']); the scene stays alive between calls and starts as Blender's factory scene (Cube, Camera, Light). Use frap_describe ('mesh.bevel', 'Object', 'Object.location') to check names, arguments, units (angles are radians) and poll requirements. A failing statement leaves the scene unchanged; read error.hint and detail.did_you_mean."}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"idname\":\"frap.select_elements\",\"bl_idname\":\"FRAP_OT_select_elements\",\"label\":\"Select Elements\",\"description\":\"Select mesh elements by index in Edit Mode (frap extension: agents cannot click)\",\"bl_options\":[\"REGISTER\",\"UNDO\"],\"kind\":\"NORMAL\",\"macro_steps\":[],\"poll\":{\"requires\":[\"MODE_EDIT_MESH\"],\"text\":\"requires Edit Mode on a mesh (bpy.ops.object.mode_set(mode='EDIT') with a mesh active)\",\"matrix\":null},\"properties\":[{\"identifier\":\"type\",\"name\":\"Type\",\"description\":\"Element type the indices refer to\",\"type\":\"ENUM\",\"subtype\":\"NONE\",\"unit\":\"NONE\",\"array\":null,\"default\":\"VERT\",\"enum_items\":[{\"identifier\":\"VERT\",\"name\":\"Vertex\",\"description\":\"Vertices (mesh.vertices order)\",\"value\":0},{\"identifier\":\"EDGE\",\"name\":\"Edge\",\"description\":\"Edges (mesh.edges order)\",\"value\":1},{\"identifier\":\"FACE\",\"name\":\"Face\",\"description\":\"Faces (mesh.polygons order)\",\"value\":2}],\"is_enum_flag\":false,\"dynamic_enum\":null,\"context_rule\":null,\"hidden\":false,\"skip_save\":true,\"flags\":[\"SKIP_SAVE\"],\"required\":false,\"unset_semantics\":null,\"frap_note\":null,\"frap_extension\":true},{\"identifier\":\"indices\",\"name\":\"Indices\",\"description\":\"Element indices (as in mesh.vertices/edges/polygons of the object leaving Edit Mode now); an index outside 0..len-1 raises IndexError\",\"type\":\"INT\",\"subtype\":\"NONE\",\"unit\":\"NONE\",\"array\":\"dynamic\",\"default\":[],\"hard_min\":-2147483648,\"hard_max\":2147483647,\"soft_min\":-2147483648,\"soft_max\":2147483647,\"hidden\":false,\"skip_save\":true,\"flags\":[\"SKIP_SAVE\"],\"required\":false,\"unset_semantics\":null,\"frap_note\":null,\"frap_extension\":true},{\"identifier\":\"action\",\"name\":\"Action\",\"description\":\"How the indices change the selection\",\"type\":\"ENUM\",\"subtype\":\"NONE\",\"unit\":\"NONE\",\"array\":null,\"default\":\"SET\",\"enum_items\":[{\"identifier\":\"SET\",\"name\":\"Set\",\"description\":\"Select exactly these elements (everything else is deselected, selection history restarts)\",\"value\":0},{\"identifier\":\"ADD\",\"name\":\"Add\",\"description\":\"Select these elements too\",\"value\":1},{\"identifier\":\"REMOVE\",\"name\":\"Remove\",\"description\":\"Deselect these elements\",\"value\":2}],\"is_enum_flag\":false,\"dynamic_enum\":null,\"context_rule\":null,\"hidden\":false,\"skip_save\":true,\"flags\":[\"SKIP_SAVE\"],\"required\":false,\"unset_semantics\":null,\"frap_note\":null,\"frap_extension\":true},{\"identifier\":\"object\",\"name\":\"Object\",\"description\":\"Name of the edit object the indices refer to (default: the active object)\",\"type\":\"STRING\",\"subtype\":\"NONE\",\"unit\":\"NONE\",\"array\":null,\"default\":\"\",\"length_max\":258,\"hidden\":false,\"skip_save\":true,\"flags\":[\"SKIP_SAVE\"],\"required\":false,\"unset_semantics\":null,\"frap_note\":null,\"frap_extension\":true}],\"frap\":{\"status\":\"implemented\",\"tier\":\"T1\",\"support\":\"full\",\"support_note\":null,\"headless\":\"native\",\"planned\":\"M2\",\"extension\":true,\"notes\":[\"frap extension: agents select by index (mesh.vertices / edges / polygons order of the edit-mode view)\",\"SET and ADD append to the selection history, so the last index becomes the active element\",\"goldens run tools/blender/emulations.py::select_elements on the Blender side\"]}}"}],"isError":false}}
